### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Send Single Catalog Product
### Maps to WhatsApp Cloud API interactive.type = "product".
### Requires a catalog linked to your WABA; product_retailer_id must match a SKU in that catalog.
### Official guide: https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/business-messaging/whatsapp/catalogs/single-product-messages
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{vendorUid}}/contact/send-single-catalog-product
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "phone_number": "919902233232",
    "catalog_id": "YOUR_CATALOG_ID",
    "product_retailer_id": "YOUR_PRODUCT_SKU",
    "body_text": "Here is the product you asked about.",
    "footer_text": "Tap to view details",
    "contact_uid": null,
    "from_phone_number_id": null
}

### Request fields:
# - phone_number (required): recipient wa_id digits without + or leading 0 (same as other vendor APIs)
# - catalog_id (required): Meta catalog id
# - product_retailer_id (required): retailer id / SKU in the catalog
# - body_text (optional): maps to interactive.body.text
# - footer_text (optional): maps to interactive.footer.text
# - contact_uid (optional): existing contact uid; if missing, contact is resolved/created via phone_number
# - from_phone_number_id (optional): send from a specific registered business phone id

### Response (Success): same envelope as other send APIs (log_uid, contact_uid, phone_number, wamid, status).

### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Send Multi-Product Catalog Message (product_list)
### Maps to WhatsApp Cloud API interactive.type = "product_list" (up to 30 product_items total).
### Official guide: https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/business-messaging/whatsapp/catalogs/multi-product-messages
### -----------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{vendorUid}}/contact/send-multi-catalog-product
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "phone_number": "919902233232",
    "catalog_id": "YOUR_CATALOG_ID",
    "header_text": "Our picks for you",
    "body_text": "Browse the items below and add to cart in WhatsApp.",
    "footer_text": "Prices may vary",
    "sections": [
        {
            "title": "Featured",
            "product_items": [
                { "product_retailer_id": "SKU-001" },
                { "product_retailer_id": "SKU-002" }
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "More options",
            "product_items": [
                { "product_retailer_id": "SKU-003" }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "contact_uid": null,
    "from_phone_number_id": null
}

### Request fields:
# - phone_number (required)
# - catalog_id (required)
# - header_text (required, max 60): interactive.header type text (Meta requires text header for product_list)
# - body_text (required, max 1024)
# - footer_text (optional, max 60)
# - sections (required): array of { title (max 24), product_items: [ { product_retailer_id } ] }
# - At most 30 product_items in total across all sections (validated server-side)
# - contact_uid, from_phone_number_id: optional, same semantics as single-product request

